# SOP Support — Environment Variables

# Client-side (Vite) variables — anything prefixed VITE_ is inlined into the
# browser bundle at build time, so only ever put values here that are safe
# for anyone to see (e.g. a Supabase publishable/anon key, protected by RLS).
# Copy this file to .env for local development and fill in your values.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# Server-side only — set these in the Cloudflare Pages dashboard under
# Settings → Environment variables. Do NOT prefix with VITE_, and do not
# put real values in this file or commit a filled-in .env: these are read
# only by functions/api/contact.ts (a Cloudflare Pages Function), which runs
# on Cloudflare's servers and never ships the value to the browser.
WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
